 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Down in the land of Egypt where the bricks were made with tears",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The people cried for freedom for four hundred years",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then Moses said, get ready now, put your sandals on your feet",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Take a lamb for every household and the bread without the yeast",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When I see the blood, I will pass over you",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "No plague will come upon you",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When I see the blood, I will pass over you",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I will pass over you",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Paint the doorposts, paint the lintel, stay inside until the dawn",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.12,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Eat it standing, eat it hurried, with your staff and your cloak on",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "At midnight came the crying all across the land",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But the houses with the blood were held in the LORD's own hand",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When I see the blood, I will pass over you",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "No plague will come upon you",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When I see the blood, I will pass over you",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I will pass over you",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "This day shall be a day of remembrance for you",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And you shall keep it as a festival to the LORD",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Throughout your generations",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 3,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
